      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I did more testing\n\nI found that after just switching a few times on the menu page\n\nThis irreversible delay will accumulate\n\nIn addition, every time the esc menu is opened, there is a lag phenomenon.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/W_LRwdE04kA?si=AazqTK_6UB7PGVbD",
