      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm having this same issue, but it's a bit more subtle. It affects both Desktop and PCVR. 5800x3D + 6700 xt. I first noticed the problem in VR, so I came hunting here.\n\nisao's reproduction steps seem to work, BUT the FPS dips don't begin until you load into the next world.\n\nThese are the exact steps: I open the game, I go to big menu, and just click on the tabs on the bottom like crazy (+100 clicks). I just cycle from left to right tabs and then back. Then I rejoin the world, and have FPS dips every second.\n\nOnce it's occurring, I can even see the FPS dips on the \"Connecting\" screens with the debug menu open, after switching worlds yet another time.\n\nI assume the problem is more obvious and obnoxious on slower CPUs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
