      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Small update! Did a bit of testing in PCVR, and after turning on the performance/debug tools using OculusDebugTool, I can see the issue is almost always occurring after switching worlds once.\n\nhttps://streamable.com/y454ve\n\nThis video is a very subtle example. The problem DOES get worse, where the FPS dips do show up in the game FPS.",
