      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Problem still occurs after the June 3rd, 2024 update, Build 1458.\n\nAlso for the previous build:\n\nI have a friend with the exact same hardware as me (5800x3D+6700xt), who does not seem to experience the problem in Desktop or VR mode.\n\nI tried downgrading my video driver (24.5.1 Full) to their exact version (23.10.2 Minimal), but the problem still occurred for me. We both have MPO (Multi-Plane Overlay) disabled.\n\nThe only other thing I can think of is their ancient Windows 10 version (on winver):\n\nMine: Windows 10 Version 22H2 (OS Build 19045.4412)\n\nThem: Windows 10 Version 1903 (OS Build 18362.1256)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
