  "details": "I also use AMD GPU RX5700 8G,\n\nThere were no issues before the update.\n\nThere is a continuous delay every second after the 2024.2.2 update...\n\nI did various tests and confirmed that this problem occurred after updating.\n\nMy situation is that whenever loading other worlds, there is a delay every second.\n\nBut if you stay in the default home world when you first log in to your account, it will work fine.\n\nThis means I can't travel to other worlds...T^T\n\nhttps://youtu.be/9NWtsCv0Pbo\n\n0:00~1:45=Execute two VRChat tests simultaneously\n\n1:46~4:12=Run other games and VRChat at the same time\n\nCPU: i7 4770／RAM: 32G",
